1 NOTE Children:
2 CONT 1. Anders Knutsen b. 1633, probate June 21, 1709, lived in Oygreid or Uygreid
2 CONT 2. Torstein Knutsen probate May 10, 1700, m. Inger Olasdtr. Lived in Eia and Sogndal
2 CONT 3. Jakob Knutsongrl. June 15, 1715. Lived in Oygreid
2 CONT 4. Jeremias Knutsen b. 1649, d. abt, 1709
2 CONT 5. Mikel Knutsen, b. 1652, died abr. 1709
2 CONT 6. Torleiv Knutsen
2 CONT 7. Anna Knutsdtr m. (1) Torleiv Olson Ramsland in Berge, then HeskuldOmundsen Lindland i Lund, then moved to Berge, Anna died abt. 1680
2 CONT 8. Guri Knutsdtr, m (1) brother of Torliev Berge, Borild OlsenRamsland who lived in Berge, M(2) Per Ivarsen Hetland b. 1665. He was a lensmann-sheriff in Hetland, shipbuilder when he lived in Ramsland
2 CONT 9. Eli Knutsdtr, d. before 1709
2 CONT 10. Astrid Knutsdtr, m. Kristen Tjerandsen Oygreid. Was alive in 1701, probate filed Jan.1, 1741
2 CONT
