1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''1701 Manntall (Torkel is listed at Bakka, and is claimed to be 46 years old at the time):'''
2 CONT RA, Manntallet 1701, nr. 4: Jæren og Dalane fogderi, 1701, s. 133-134. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10041010271081
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Skoskatten 1711 (Torkel is s listed at Bakka with his wife and 5 children):'''
2 CONT Rentekammeret inntil 1814, Reviderte regnskaper, Fogderegnskap, AV/RA-EA-4092/R46/L2735: Fogderegnskap Jæren og Dalane, 1711, s. 300. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk10081305100305
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record (18-01-1730; Torkel had died, and the heirs were listed as the widow, Else Svensdatter, and their 4 children: Siri Torkelsdatter, 36 years old; Guri Torkelsdatter, 29 years old; Bjørn Torkelsen, 34 years old; and
2 CONC  the deceased Anna Torkelsdatter, who had been married at Åmot, and left 2 sons and 1 daughter):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, AV/SAST-A-100306/5/50BA/L0007: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL, 1727-1730, s. 208b-209a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106690214
2 CONT ----
