1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The probate record after [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650350 Knut Håversen Ovedal/ Konstali (Lindland), dated 05-07-1676], lists only 4 living chldren at the time, i.e. Håver, Østen, Torjus, and Sigbjør
2 CONC n. There is no indication there that this Knut was the father of Gunlaug Knutsdatter Østre Barstad. 
2 CONT Furthermore, there is no indication in [https://www.wisted.net/o-barstad.html "Stein Norem Wisteds Ættesoge for Sokndal"] of the same. 
2 CONT '''The suggestion that Knut Håversen Ovedal/ Konstali (Lindland) was the father of Gunlaug Knutsdatter Østre Barstad seems to be speculative at best.'''
2 CONT ----
