1 NAME Lars Knutsen /Myklebust/
2 GIVN Lars Knutsen
2 SURN Myklebust
2 _MARNM Myklebust
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1676
2 PLAC Myklebust,bnr.1
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Norge
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1723
2 PLAC Myklebust
