2 CONT '''Probate record (20-07-1688; Salve had died and the heirs were listed as the widow, Ingeborg Endresdatter, and their 5 children: Endre Salvesen; Salve Salvesen; Håver Salvesen; Lars Salvesen; and Gitlaug Salvesdatter; as well as
