1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Is there any evidence for the stated birth year of 1712?
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Some contributors here at Geni speculate that Siri Bjørnsdatter Indre Mydland was a daughter of Bjørn Bergulvsen Indre Mydland and Ågot Steffensdatter Årrestad. This seems to be pure speculation based on the patronym only. Siri Bj
2 CONC ørnsdatter seems to be far too young to be a daughter of Bjørn Bergulvsen Indre Mydland and Ågot Steffensdatter Årrestad. Moreover, Bjørn Bergulvsen Indre Mydland and Ågot Steffensdatter Årrestad were the parents of Ole Bjørnsen I
2 CONC ndre Mydland, the father of Bjørn Olsen Indre Mydland, the husband of Siri Bjørnsdatter Indre Mydland.
2 CONT ----
