1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Skoskatten 1711 (Guri Sigbjørnsdatter and her II husband Sigbjørn Karlsen are listed at Øvre Sandsmark, with 2 children):'''
2 CONT Rentekammeret inntil 1814, Reviderte regnskaper, Fogderegnskap, RA/EA-4092/R46/L2735: Fogderegnskap Jæren og Dalane, 1711, s. 440. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk10081305100448
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Reference: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Kv.II.562.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kvinesdal I.422.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole Torkelsen Gjemlestad was born in 1668 at Gjemlestad, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Anna Thomasdtr Rødland, daughter of Thomas Isaksen Egeland and Susanne Henriksdtr Schurmann Stavanger, before 1700. He married Anne
2 CONC  Torsdtr Sandsmark,
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of Tore Toresen Sandsmark and Guri Sigbjørnsdtr Seland, after 1715. He died in 1759 at Rødland, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He left a will on 7 Feb 1759.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Torsdtr Sandsmark was also known as Anna Torkelsdtr Sandsmark. She was born circa 1685 at Sandsmark, Bakke, Vest Agder, Norway. She witnessed the will of Tore Toresen Sandsmark on 23 Feb 1696 at Sandsmark ytre. She married Ca
2 CONC rl Andersen Konstali, son of Anders Tollaksen Sandsmark and Mette Carlsdtr Hove. She married Ole Torkelsen Gjemlestad, son of Torkel Olsen Gjemlestad and Anna d.e. Torkelsdtr Drange, after 1715. She died after 1766 at Rødland, Kvi
2 CONC nesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She witnessed the will of Tor Carlsen Konstali and Anna Olsdtr Åros on 6 Jun 1766 at Århus.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Gyland 412.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nes 2.I.531.
2 CONT
2 CONT Guri Sigbjørnsdtr Seland was born circa 1648 at Gyland, Gyland, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Tore Toresen Sandsmark, son of Tore Toresen Sandsmark, circa 1664. She married Sigbjørn Carlsen Konstali, son of Carl Andersen Konstal
2 CONC i and Anna Iversdtr ?,
2 CONT
2 CONT circa 1689. She witnessed the will of Tore Toresen Sandsmark on 23 Feb 1696 at Sandsmark ytre. She witnessed the will of Magnhild Sigbjørnsdtr Seland on 24 May 1708 at Seland. She witnessed the will of Torgier Toresen Sandsmark on
2 CONC  1 Feb 1709 at Sandsmark ytre. She married Thomas Isaksen Egeland, son of  sheriff (lensmann) Isak Jørgensen Egeland and Abel Danielsdtr Haneberg, before 1725.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tore Toresen Sandsmark was born at Sandsmark ytre, Bakke, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Guri Sigbjørnsdtr Seland, daughter of Sigbjørn Corsmissen Feda and Turid Olufsdtr Heggland, circa 1664. He died in 1695/96 at Sandsmark øvre,
2 CONC  Bakke, Vest Agder, Norway. He left a will on 23 Feb 1696 at Sandsmark ytre. He kilde, B.N. He witnessed the will of Torgier Toresen Sandsmark on 1 Feb 1709 at Sandsmark ytre.
