1 NAME Jorunn Gunnarsdatter /Strømstad/
2 GIVN Jorunn Gunnarsdatter
2 _MARNM Strømstad
1 SEX F
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1745
2 PLAC Kløgtveit
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.helgeland.nu/english/genealogy/Other/Stavanger/joergine_svela.htm#i41685
2 CONT
2 CONT Jorunn Gunnarsdotter, daughter of Gunnar Børildson and Maren Toresdotter, was born in Strømstad, Helleland, Rogaland, NOR and died circa 1745 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Other names for Jorunn were Joren and Jorind.
2 CONT
2 CONT Noted events in her life were:
2 CONT
2 CONT *She had an estate probated on 28. Jan 1745 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *Jorunn married Lars Olson on 17. Feb 1724 in Helleland kyrkje, Helleland, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *Jorunn next married Asbjørn Olson, son of Ole Johannesson and Malena Asbjørnsdotter, on 19. Oct 1732 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT *i. Malena Asbjørnsdotter was born in 1733 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 20. Sep 1733 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in Dec 1733 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, and was bu
2 CONC ried on 1. Jan 1734 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *ii. Malena Asbjørnsdotter was born in 1735 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR and was christened on 20. Feb 1735 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Malena married Nils Olson on 15. Oct 1756 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, B
2 CONC jerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *iii. Maren Asbjørnsdotter was born in 1738 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 26. Jan 1738 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1772 in Røysland søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 34, 
2 CONC and was buried on 24. May 1772 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. 
