1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Skoskatten 1711 (Ole and Anna are listed at Gjersdal with 1 child):'''
2 CONT Rentekammeret inntil 1814, Reviderte regnskaper, Fogderegnskap, RA/EA-4092/R46/L2735: Fogderegnskap Jæren og Dalane, 1711, s. 441. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk10081305100449
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after her mother (28-02-1693; the mother had died and the daughter Anna Steinberg is listed among the heirs):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0002: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650664
2 CONT ----
2 CONT There is some confusion in the sources regarding the wives of Peder Nilsen Røyland and Sigbjørn Alfsen Gjersdal. According to [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=93 "Lunds historie" (p.93)],Peder Nilsen 
2 CONC Røyland was married I time to the widow after Sigbjørn Alfsen Gjersdal. According to [https://www.nb.no/items/77c60739b529aa5e7ddf70e0f4525809?page=303 "Sirdal bygdebok" (p.300)] a daughter of Ole Kjetilsen Finsnes, named Anna Ols
2 CONC datter, was married three times: first to Atlak Pedersen Steinberg, then to Sigbjørn Alfsen Gjersdal, and finally to Peder Nilsen Røyland. According to "Lunds historie" ([https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?pa
2 CONC ge=581 p. 580] and [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=30 p.29]), the widow after Atlak Pedersen Steinberg, Anna Olsdatter Finsnes, was married II time to Sigbjørn Alfsen Gjersdal. [https://www.nb.no/ite
2 CONC ms/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=30 "Lunds historie" (p.29)] goes on to state that this marriage must have been very short, as the widow was married III time to Peder Nilsen Røyland.
2 CONT '''The main reason why it is hard to fit these facts/claims into an actual timeline is that it is not correct.'''
2 CONT '''Anna Olsdatter Finsnes was never married to Sigbjørn Alfsen Gjersdal; she was married to his brother, Ole Alfsen Gjersdal. Furthermore, she was never married to Peder Nilsen Røyland.''' The evidence for this can be found in the
2 CONC  1701 Manntall and "Skoskatten" of 1711. The former states that [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10041010271063 Ole Alfsen Gjersdal was living at Gjersdal with his step-son Ståle Atlaksen], i.e. the son of Atlak Pedersen Steinberg
2 CONC . The latter states that [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk10081305100449 Ole Alfsen Gjersdal was married to an 'Anna Olsdatter']; and it also states that [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk10081305100450 Peder Nilsen Røyland was mar
2 CONC ried to an 'Ågot Johansdatter'], i.e. the widow after Sigbjørn Alfsen Gjersdal.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=581 "Lunds historie", Bind 1 (G. nr. 38 - Steinberg, Br. nr. 14 - Gavlen, I. Atlak Pedersen, p. 580)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/77c60739b529aa5e7ddf70e0f4525809?page=303 "Sirdal bygdebok: Gard og ætt", Bind 2 (Finsnes, Gnr. 35, "Båtstø", Lnr. 66, 2. Ole Kidelsen Finsnes, p. 300)]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * Om føring av navn på konene: http://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000014254577050 '''[THIS LINK APPEARS TO BE INACTIVE]'''
2 CONT * Lund historie I, Gårdens og slektens liv, Røyland, side 93, nr. VI
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lund historie I, Gårdens og slektens liv, Røyland, side 93, nr. VI'''
2 CONT Peder Nilssen. foregåendes sønn, f. 1671, 30 år 1701.
2 CONT G. I g. m. enken etter Sigbjørn Alfsen Gjersdal, br. nr. 1.
2 CONT Det var stor aldersskilnad mellom dem, og han fikk 4 stebarn, n. under Gjersdal. 
2 CONT I dette ekteskap kjennes en sønn:
2 CONT * 1. Jon Pedersen, f. 1694, 7 år 1701. Må være død ung.
2 CONT Peder g. II g. med en ung kone:
2 CONT Siri Rasmusdatter, f. 1711, grl. 3-4-1765, 54 år gml. Peder grl. 8-4-1754, 83 år.
2 CONT Barn:
2 CONT * 2. Ågot, dpt. 13-5-1737, g. 9-3-1759 m. Ståle Olsen Ovedal. De bodde i Djupedal.
2 CONT * 3. Ingeborg, f. 1739. Trolovet 26-3-1763, senere g. m. Bjørn Knutsen Lindeli, Bakke.
2 CONT * 4. Gunvor, dpt. 13-1-1740. G. 20-10-1774 m. enkem. Sven Olsen Eike, br. nr. 1.
2 CONT * 5. Ragnhild, dpt. 15-4-1742. G. 3-11-1773 m. Jon Hanssen Solbjørg, br. 4.
2 CONT * 6. Sara, dpt. 29-11-1747, d. ung.
2 CONT * 7. Nils, se nedenfor.
2 CONT * 8. Ole, g. i Nes 21-8-1774 m. Anna Malena Hansdatter Helland, se Liland, br. nr. 1.
2 CONT Siri g. II g. 8-11-1757 m. enkemann Asbjørn Omundsen Skjeggestad, br. nr. 2. Det ser ut til at Asbjørn tok hånd om begge gårdene. Ingen barn i dette ekteskap.
