1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Birth/baptism:'''
2 CONT There are no church records for Sokndal from before 1729. According to 1701 Manntall he was 1 years old at the time, thus born about 1700. This is supported by his burial record which states that he was 30 years old at death.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Manntallet 1701''', nr. 4: Jæren og Dalane fogderi, Sogendahls præiestegield og hoffved sougn, Gård: Wester Barestad. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/view/205/oc00000000675354
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage record (27-12-1724):'''
2 CONT Helleland sokneprestkontor, SAST/A-101810: Ministerialbok nr. A 1 /1, 1713-1761, s. 35. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618620371
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Burial record (11-06-1730, 30 years old at death):'''
2 CONT Helleland sokneprestkontor, SAST/A-101810: Ministerialbok nr. A 1 /1, 1713-1761, s. 46. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618620382
