1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.choicemn.com/trees/larson-eiken/3553.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Lars Østensen MYKLEBUST===
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Born''': 1739, Myklebust, Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway [1] 
2 CONT * '''Baptized:''' 10 May 1739, Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway [2] 
2 CONT * '''Marriage''' (1): Brynille Thordsdatter MYKJE ca 1757 in <Norway>   
2 CONT * '''Marriage''' (2): Anne Christensdatter HARALDSEID about 1775 in <Norway> 
2 CONT * '''Died:''' 1805, Gismarvik, Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway at age 66 
2 CONT * '''Buried:''' 11 Jan 1805, Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway 
2 CONT * ''' Other names''' for Lars were Lars Ostensen GISMARVIG, Lars Østenson GISMERVIG and Lars Østensen MØGLEBUSTAD.
2 CONT * '''Spouses/Children:''' 
2 CONT ** 1. '''Brynille Thordsdatter MYKJE''' 
2 CONT ***	Ranveg Larsdatter GISMERVIG
2 CONT ***	Østen Larsen MYKJE
2 CONT ***	Sigri Sophia Larsdatter GISMERVIG
2 CONT ***	Osten Larsen GISMERVIG
2 CONT ***	Lars Larsen GISMERVIG
2 CONT ** 2. '''Anne Christensdatter HARALDSEID''' 
2 CONT ***	Brynilla Larsdatter GISMERVIG
2 CONT ***	Østen Larsen GISMERVIG+
2 CONT ***	Lars Larsen GISMERVIG
2 CONT ***	Christina Larsdatter GISMARVIG+
2 CONT ***	Lars Larsen GISMERVIG
2 CONT ***	Peder Larsen GISMERVIG
2 CONT ***	Christen Larsen GISMERVIG
2 CONT ***	Sigri Sophie Larsdatter GISMERVIG
2 CONT ***	Anna Larsdatter GISMARVIK+
2 CONT * Christening Notes:  Dom. 6 post Pascha [should this be 3 May 1739?]
2 CONT * '''Census:''' farm Gismervig, 1801, Avaldsnes, Karmøy, Rogaland, Norway. County district Parish Local parish Gard/hus 45 Stavanger Augvaldsnæs Augvaldsnæs Gismervig   
2 CONT ** New household '''Given name Last name Household pos. Age Marital status Occupation Remarks Sex'''  
2 CONT *** 1342 * Lars Østensen Huusbonde 61 Givt 2den gang Bonde og grdbr. M  
2 CONT *** 1343 Anna Christensdtr Hans kone 45 Givt 1te gang K  
2 CONT *** 1344 Østen Larsen Deres søn 25 Ugivt Enroul. matros [deckhand] M  
2 CONT *** 1345 Lars Larsen Deres 2den søn 18 Reserve matros M  
2 CONT *** 1346 Peder Larsen Deres 3die søn 16 Reserve matros M  
2 CONT *** 1347 Christen Larsen Deres 4de søn 13 M  
2 CONT *** 1348 Brynilla Larsdtr Deres datter 27 Ugivt K  
2 CONT *** 1349 Christina Larsdtr Deres 2den datter 22 Ugivt K 
2 CONT ***  1350 Siri Sophia Larsdtr Deres 3die datter 9 K  
2 CONT *** 1351 Anna Larsdtr Deres 4de datter 5 K  
2 CONT *** 1352 Ole Johansen Tienestedreng 23 Ugivt Reserve matros M  
2 CONT *** 1353 Guri Olsdtr Tienestepige 45 Ugivt K 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Reference:''' Tysvær, Gard og ætt3, 1993, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. GISMARVIK, p19  
2 CONT
2 CONT * Lars og Brynhild kom hit til halve Gismarvik like etter at dei var gifte og tok då over 1 pund korn, det er halve garden. Han åtte heile garden etter skøyte frå Knut Larssen Myklebust, Lars Helgesen Odland og fleire datert 11.6.
2 CONC 1768. Andre kona henta han på nabobruket. Ikring 1790 tok han over også den adnre halvedelen og dei sat då som brukarar av heile Gismarvik aleine nokre år til dei let sonen Osten få koma inn på det eine korpundet i 1799. 
2 CONT ** ['''google translation'''] Lars and Brynhild got here at half Gismarvik shortly after they were married and then took over the 1 pound grain, it is half the garden. He's eight whole farm after skating from Knut Larssen Myklebus
2 CONC t, Lars Helgesen Odland and more dated 11.06.1768. Second wife he regulated the neighboring farm. Fuse 1790 he took over also the another force half portion and they sat when that users of all Gismarvik alone a few years until the
2 CONC y look zone Osten few come in on the cue korpundet in 1799.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Lars married Brynille Thordsdatter MYKJE,''' 
2 CONT **daughter of Tore Knutsen MYKJE and Susanne Larsdatter MYKLEBUST, ca 1757 in <Norway>. 
2 CONT ** Brynille Thordsdatter MYKJE was born about 1735 in <Norway>, 
2 CONT ** died in 1771 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway and 
2 CONT ** was buried on 1 Apr 1771 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway [3].
2 CONT ** '''Marriage Notes:''' 1st cousins - might be why their children didn't live long
2 CONT * '''Lars next married Anne Christensdatter HARALDSEID,''' 
2 CONT ** daughter of Kristen Kristenson HARALDSEID and Inger Pedersdatter HARALDSEID, about 1775 in <Norway>. 
2 CONT ** Anne Christensdatter HARALDSEID was born in 1753 in Skjold, Rogaland, Norway, 
2 CONT ** baptized on 15 Apr 1753 in Skjold, Rogaland, Norway [4] and 
2 CONT ** died after Jan 1813 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources:===
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1 Tysvær Gard og ætt 3, Tysvær Kommune, 1993, 19.
2 CONT * 2 Avaldsnes in Avaldsnes 1711-1764 (Arkivverket), p59, last on first column, continued to second column, 1739.
2 CONT * 3 Avaldsnes in Avaldsnes 1765-1800 (Arkivverket), p57, 2nd entry, 1771.
2 CONT * 4 Skjold, Tysvær, Vats in Skjold 1743-1802 (Arkivverket), <mangler> 1753 page, 3rd column, line 11, 1753.
2 CONT
2 CONT  **********************
