2 CONT REFNa59 [Woodard.ged]  [Master.ftw]  Married Kari Zachariasdatter Viland, took over the Viland estate, and  changed his name to Viland, as was the custom.  In 1814, when Norwas declared her independence from Denmark, Rasmus Viland
2 CONC  was a member of the first  national Storting as is remembered as one of Vikedal's illustrious men.  "FamilySearch"
