1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Skoskatten 1711 (Bjørn is listed at Urdal with his wife and children):'''
2 CONT Rentekammeret inntil 1814, Reviderte regnskaper, Fogderegnskap, RA/EA-4092/R46/L2735: Fogderegnskap Jæren og Dalane, 1711, s. 296. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk10081305100301
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1758 Sjeleregister at Sokndal (Guri is probably the person living at Urdal and claimed to be 67 years old at the time):'''
2 CONT Fylkesmannen i Rogaland, SAST/A-101928/99/3/325/325CA/L0017: SJELEREGISTER JÆREN OG DALANE PRESTEGJELD, 1758, s. 20. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20060620030191
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after her I husband (10-04-1717; Bjørn was dead, and the widow, Guri Hansdatter, is listed among his heirs):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0005: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106670119
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after her I husband (10-04-1717; Bjørn was dead, and the widow, Guri Hansdatter, is listed among his heirs):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5, 1714-1722, s. 263. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20110328660263
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record after her II husband (05-06-1741; Rasmus was dead, and the widow, Guri Hansdatter, is listed among his heirs):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0008A: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL <1-348>, 1740-1741, s. 175b-176a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106690428
2 CONT ----
2 CONT According to [https://www.wisted.net/urdal.html "Stein Norem Wisteds Ættesoge for Sokndal"] Guri Hansdatter Urdal (Store Åmdal) was born in 1699. '''This is highly unlikely''', as she, according to the [https://www.digitalarkivet.
2 CONC no/sk20081106670119 probate after her I husband], gave birth to 4 children, with him between about 1711 and 1717. [https://www.wisted.net/urdal.html "Stein Norem Wisteds Ættesoge for Sokndal"] also states that she died in 1774. Th
2 CONC ere is indeed a burial record for a Guri Urdal, [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070625630441 dated 27-01-1774], who had died at the age of 76 years. Yet, it seems unlikely that this is the burial record of Guri Hansdatter Urdal
2 CONC  (Store Åmdal). According to the 1758 Sjeleregister at Sokndal, '''there were two women named Guri living at Urdal at the time''': one 60 years old, and the other 67 years old. The former was most likely Guri Hansdatter married to
2 CONC  Jens Halvorsen Urdal, and it was most likely she that died in 1774. The other was most likely Guri Hansdatter Urdal (Store Åmdal), living with 'føderåd' with Ole Tollaksen Urdal and his wife Berte Larsdatter Urdal (Mydland-Indre)
2 CONC .
2 CONT ----
