1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sogneprestenes manntall 1664-1666 (10-02-1664; Brynild is listed at Eide with no indication of his age at the time):'''
2 CONT RA, Sogneprestenes manntall 1664-1666, nr. 17: Jæren prosti og Dalane prosti, 1664-1666, s. 252-253. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10051005180141
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes manntall 1664-1666 (12-05-1664; Brynild is claimed to be 53 years old at the time):'''
2 CONT RA, Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes manntall 1664-1666, nr. 10: Lista len, 1664, s. 48. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10051005312033
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes manntall 1664-1666 (not dated; Brynild is claimed to be 53 years old at the time):'''
2 CONT RA, Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes manntall 1664-1666, nr. 10: Lista len, 1664, s. 154-155. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10051005312089
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record (13-03-1684; Brynild had died and the heirs were listed as the widow, Birgitte Torkelsdatter, who was awarded føderåd, and their 6 children: Salve Brynildsen; Atlak Brynildsen; Magnhild Brynildsdatter, married to
2 CONC  Torkel Straumland; Karen Brynildsdatter, married to Didrik Liland; Ingrid Brynildsdatter, married to Anders Soland; and Gunhild Brynildsdatter, married to Torkel Flikka):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, AV/SAK-1221-0003/H/Hc/L0004: Skifteprotokoll nr 4 med register, 1682-1688, s. 98b-99a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081029330113
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record (13-03-1684; Brynild had died and the heirs were listed as the widow, Birgitte Torkelsdatter, who was awarded føderåd, and their 6 children: Salve Brynildsen; Atlak Brynildsen; Magnhild Brynildsdatter, married to
2 CONC  Torkel Straumland; Karen Brynildsdatter, married to Didrik Liland; Ingrid Brynildsdatter, married to Anders Soland; and Gunhild Brynildsdatter, married to Torkel Flikka):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, AV/SAK-1221-0003/H, s. 5513. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk11214091205513
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Some sources, also here at Geni, suggest that Brynild Salvesen Eide (Hamre) had another daughter that was married to Hans Nilsen Solbjørg.  [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=88 "Lunds historie"] states
2 CONC  that the name of the wife of Hans Nilsen Solbjørg is not known, but that she was probably a daughter of Brynild Salvesen Eide (Hamre). This seems more than unlikely as she no such daughter is mentioned in the probate after Brynil
2 CONC d Salvesen Eide (Hamre), [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081029330113 dated 13-03-1684], or in the probate after Salve Brynildsen Flikka/ Skjeggestad/ Eide (Eide), [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081029340185dated 23-05-1695
2 CONC ]. The latter died without any children of his own and was inherited by his siblings. The fact that neither of these two probates make any reference to a daughter married to Hans Nilsen Solbjørg, or the children of such a daughter
2 CONC , is a very strong indication that '''the wife of Hans Nilsen Solbjørg was NOT a daughter of Brynild Salvesen Eide (Hamre)'''.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * Lund historie I, Gårdens og slektens liv, Hamre, side 225, nr. IV.2
2 CONT
