2 CONT Karl was blind. In 1619 Karl is charged for having had a sexual liaison with at "loose woman" name Eline. His father paid a fine of 2 riksdaler on Karl's behalf. It thus seems likely that Karl was a minor, i.e. less than 25 years 
2 CONC old, at the time.
