2 CONC  3 children; 5) Birgitte, married to Stenu Brynildsen Skår; 6) Marit, who is dead, but had been married to Salve Pedersen, and left 6 children):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0009A: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL <1-346>, 1744-1749, s. 107b-108a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106700111
