1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Marriage record I (26-12-1699):'''
2 CONT SAKO, Hjartdal kirkebøker, F/Fa/L0001: Ministerialbok nr. I 1, 1685-1714, s. 30-31. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20051007050526
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage record II (03-11-1701):'''
2 CONT SAKO, Hjartdal kirkebøker, F/Fa/L0001: Ministerialbok nr. I 1, 1685-1714, s. 56-57. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20051007050539
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage record III (10-06-1729):'''
2 CONT SAKO, Hjartdal kirkebøker, F/Fa/L0004: Ministerialbok nr. I 4, 1727-1795, s. 5. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061212310538
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Burial record (10-09-1758; Gunvor is claimed to be 85 years old at death):'''
2 CONT SAKO, Hjartdal kirkebøker, F/Fa/L0003: Ministerialbok nr. I 3, 1727-1775, s. 132. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061212310522
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record after her I husband (18-11-1701; Hans Larsen had died, and the heirs are listed as the widow, Gunvor Sørensdatter, and their son Søren Hansen):'''
2 CONT Øvre Telemark østfjelske sorenskriveri, AV/SAKO-A-213/H/Hb/Hba/L0004: Skifteprotokoll, 1700-1703, s. 80b-81a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20090120620421
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after her father (11-07-1699; 	Søren Jonsen had died and Gunvor Sørensdatter is listed among the heirs):'''
2 CONT Øvre Telemark østfjelske sorenskriveri, AV/SAKO-A-213/H/Hb/Hba/L0003: Skifteprotokoll, 1697-1700, s. 103b-104a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20090120620251
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after her mother (10-03-1699); 	Ragnhild Olsdatter ahd died and Gunvor Sørensdatter is listed among the heirs):'''
2 CONT Øvre Telemark østfjelske sorenskriveri, AV/SAKO-A-213/H/Hb/Hba/L0003: Skifteprotokoll, 1697-1700, s. 79b-80a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20090120620227
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after her II husband (16-06-1727; Nils Hansen had died, and the heirs were listed as the widow, Gunvor Sørensdatter, and their 6 children: Hans d.e. Nilsen, 24 years old; Gunleik d.y. Nilsen, 21 years old; Ole Ni
2 CONC lsen, 18 years old; Halvor Nilsen, 9 years old; Mari Nilsdatter, 15 years old; Margit Nilsdatter, 12 years old):'''
2 CONT Nedre Telemark sorenskriveri, AV/SAKO-A-135/H/Hb/Hba/L0008: Skifteprotokoll, 1720-1727, s. 450b-451a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20090113630821
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''1730 Sjeleregister at Sauland (Gunvor Sørensdatter is listed at Leine, and is claimed to be 54 years old at the time):'''
2 CONT Bratsberg len og amt, AV/SAKO-A-943/I/I34/L0342/0004: Diverse manntall og fortegnelser / Manntall over gårder og innbyggere i Hjartdal prestegjeld, 1730, s. 12. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/db60047720000078
2 CONT ----
