1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Skoskatten 1711 (Todne was living at Osen, as a female servant, with her half-brother Ellef Bjørnsen):'''
2 CONT Rentekammeret inntil 1814, Reviderte regnskaper, Fogderegnskap, RA/EA-4092/R46/L2735: Fogderegnskap Jæren og Dalane, 1711, s. 446. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk10081305100454
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record (02-04-1718; Todne was dead, without any living children, and her heirs are her widower Jakob Jakobsen and her siblings and half-sblings. Her full siblings are listed as: Berte d.e. Bjørnsdatter, married to Leiel
2 CONC  Bjørnsen Haukland; Anna Bjørnsdatter, 29 years old, living at Bergen; and Berte d.y. Bjørnsdatter, 26 years old, living at Bergen. Her half-siblings are listed as: Ellef Bjørnsen Osen and Besse Bjørnsen Eie):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0005: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106670188
2 CONT ----
